  "reference": "Uniform unit-area slab with k=C=1 and independent piecewise-linear wall temperatures. FVM uses second-order face fluxes and Crank-Nicolson with dt <= dx^2/2 and internal splits at the ramp knots. For each reporting window compare true Fourier cell means at its endpoints and cumulative heat differences at every face and at 25%, 50%, 75% inside every cell. Check reconstructed endpoint heats against both native cell-side transfers every step.",
